! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''.a'a''

;__.a'a__ (UI1): attentive.  This word is an attitudinal, that is, it directly expresses an emotion on the part of the speaker.  This word is part of a scale; the base attitudinal word indicates that the speaker is feeling attentive, the base word followed by cu'i indicates that the speaker is feeling inattentive, and the base word followed by nai indicates that the speaker is feeling avoiding.(cf. jundi, rivbi)
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''.a'a'' Usage

